<title>INDIA: Daimler stake rises to 76 pct in India unit.</title>
<headline>Daimler stake rises to 76 pct in India unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Industry Ministry on Thursday said it had approved an increase of Daimler-Benz AG's stake in its India unit to 76 percent from 51 percent.  </p>
<p>An Industry Ministry statement, listing recent foreign direct investment (FDI) approvals, also said Daimler-Benz would invest an additional 1.78 billion rupees ($49.9 million) in its India joint venture with Tata Engineering and Locomotive Co Ltd (TELCO).  </p>
<p>The Industry Ministry statement said the new investment related to &quot;car engines&quot; but did not give further details.</p>
